language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

contract SimulatorControlContract.
interface SimulatorControlInterface.
message-set SimulatorControlRequests.
message-set SimulatorControlResponses.

SimulatorControlInterface follows SimulatorControlContract.
SimulatorControlContract allows SimulatorControlRequests.
SimulatorControlContract specifies "Simulator-only truth/control path. Preserve exact same-command-ID recovery; command result and observation routes are distinct. Both schemas and README are authority.".
SimulatorControlContract status inherited.
SimulatorControlContract allows SimulatorControlResponses.
SimulatorControlContract schema "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/contracts/browser/simulator/v1/simulator-control.schema.json".
SimulatorControlRequests describes "SimulatorControl incoming message family; exact allowed variants follow the cited schema or the associated contract gap.".
SimulatorControlResponses describes "SimulatorControl outgoing message family; payload schema and variant routing need the declared contract.".
